02 (AI-Scientist-v2) patch for the shared file automation/scripts/generate_babylm_native_inputs.py
Applied at run time by real_eval/adapters/shared_layer_overlay.py; the shared file itself
stays byte-identical to upstream.

AI-Scientist-v2 topic rendering only:
  * the domain list is read from the materialized dataset instead of a stale hard-coded list
    (nodes build file paths from the topic text; a wrong name made them fall back to synthetic
    data) (4824615, 2026-09-21)
  * states that a reference module is provided at run time and that experiments run on the
    provided corpus only (6ccf3c8, 2026-09-24)
  * defines a result as the perplexity reported by the reference validation function on its
    fixed validation lines (89be78d, 2026-09-24)

--- a/automation/scripts/generate_babylm_native_inputs.py
